# Database
# Local SQLite persistence layer (offline store-and-forward queue):
# - local_database.dart: Handles on-device SQLite database operations
#   * messages: Pending outgoing, relayed, and received messages
#   * seen_messages: Table of seen message IDs for loop and duplicate suppression
#   * family_contacts: Offline cache of registered family relationships
#   * user_profile: Local node credentials (User ID, Name, Phone, Node ID)
